Preamble. This project is a personal price aggregator for grocery networks.
Most of its value comes from the effort of people who fix things, report bugs
and send improvements back. The license below therefore (a) forbids selling
the software or any derivative of it, (b) requires that anyone who publishes
a modified version publishes the complete corresponding source code under this
same license, and (c) asks — without legally requiring it — that improvements
be offered to the main repository first, so that everyone benefits from them.

Third-party components are NOT covered by this license. They keep their own
licenses, listed in NOTICE. In particular the category icons in assets/icons/
are Font Awesome Free (Solid) by Fonticons, Inc., licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 (texts in assets/icons/CC-BY-4.0.txt and
assets/icons/LICENSE). The icons were MODIFIED: scaled and shifted into a
common 24x24 frame (see assets/icons/README.md), as CC BY 4.0 section 3(a)
requires that changes be indicated.

